    <string name="about_title">About the author</string>
    <string name="about_author">Borislav Zahariev (BZ)</string>
    <string name="about_body">BZ Music is a simple local music player for Android. Browse your device library or pick a folder, then play common audio formats with shuffle and repeat.\n\nIt can also play WMA files (via built-in LibVLC), which stock Android players usually cannot.\n\nOptional internet use is only for looking up album art when a track has no embedded cover.</string>
